OL,4,BFoxes split with sponsor after porn    
OL,5,Bactress row                            
OL,6,GLeicester City have parted ways with   
OL,7,Gtheir main shirt sponsor after the     
OL,8,Ggambling firm appointed a porn actress 
OL,9,Gas an ambassador.                      
OL,11,FBC Game - which was named as a sponsor 
OL,12,Ffor the League One side at the start   
OL,13,Fof the 2024-25 season - named Eva      
OL,14,FElfie as a brand ambassador earlier    
OL,15,Fthis month.                            
OL,17,FThe online gambling company posted a   
OL,18,Fvideo of Elfie and a delivery driver   
OL,19,Fon social media, with the caption:     
OL,20,F"Welcome to BC Game Eva Elfie! Let the 
OL,21,Ffun begin."                            
